:: MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
退潮后的三号栈桥露出湿漉漉的青石阶，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>先就着风灯读过黄铜水尺，才翻开舱桌上的副册。他说港里的零碎活计得顺着潮汐排：描潮痕板、引无灯煤船与补船屋漏顶归在栈桥日务，推搁浅浮标与送守夜姜茶归在夜潮港务，外礁灯船、拆船旧坞与海雾节返航夜则另记在远航专页。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回船屋 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[先看栈桥日务 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mptideicon>><<link [[先翻夜潮港务页 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[查看外海与海雾节 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
栈桥日务页记着船屋门外的三桩急活。门框上取下的杉木旧潮痕板<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper10>>已经对照水尺重新烫清了刻痕<<else>>被海风啃得发灰，急需用烧红的铁签重描刻度<</if>>；防波堤外<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper11>>那条无灯运煤驳船已经引回内港泊位<<else>>有一条没挂灯的运煤驳船困在浓雾里，得打灯语引航<</if>>；船屋的斜顶<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper12>>已经铺好油毡并用石板压实<<else>>昨夜被急雨淋漏了一处椽缝，正往下滴水<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把风灯递到你手边。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[重描旧潮痕板 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 10]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[打灯语引煤驳船 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 11]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬上屋顶铺布堵漏 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 12]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
夜潮港务页记着退潮底与深宵的两桩差事。港口外沿标示礁脊的绿浮标<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper13>>已经推回航道拐角并重砸了铁锚桩<<else>>被昨夜侧浪扯松锚链搁在了泥滩上，不趁早潮前复位会害夜船触礁<</if>>；栈桥尽头守夜的老船工<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper14>>已经喝上滚热的锡壶姜茶并换了干衣<<else>>在海风里咳了一整宿，正等着一壶热姜茶与替班擦灯的人<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>拎起锡壶看你先走哪一处。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回副册总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[下滩推绿浮标 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 13]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[给守夜老人送姜茶 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 14]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _vesperYearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
远航专页记着两趟出港同行与秋日海雾节返航夜。外礁那座无人值守的红漆灯船<<if $daily.mpNpcDateVesper5>>今日已经登船添过油并查过锚链<<else>>平潮时分正好靠船，得上去换灯芯查锚链<</if>>；鱼市后头的旧拆船坞<<if $daily.mpNpcDateVesper6>>今日已经去取回了旧船铜名牌<<else>>趁低潮拖上了一条老船，他想去把船尾那块铜名牌赎回来<</if>>。至于海雾节的返航守夜，<<if (_npc.festivalYear or 0) is _vesperYearNow>>今年的返航舱单已经落印封存<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>眼下正是备油缝帆迎船的时节<<else>>要等秋雾锁港时才会挂出返航灯语<</if>>。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先登外礁灯船 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Date 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[前往鱼市旧船坞 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Date 6]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<if _npc.hasMet and Time.season is "autumn" and ((_npc.festivalYear or 0) isnot _vesperYearNow)>><<mplampicon>><<link [[翻看海雾节返航册 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Festival Prep]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">海雾节未启（需秋季且今年未过）</span><</if>>
:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
潮水刚退过石阶中段，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把门框上的杉木旧潮痕板取下来平放在舱桌上。木板面上刻着历年大潮与浓雾的铁签印，如今被海风蚀得发浅；得趁退潮对照黄铜水尺，用烧红的铁签把今年的平流线与暗流记号重新烫深。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper10>>潮痕板已经重新挂回门框，焦黑的新刻度在风灯下格外分明。<<else>>炭盆里的铁签尖端正泛着暗红。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回栈桥日务 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[照旧痕烫刻度 (0:09)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 9>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper10 to 1>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper10 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[对照水尺重校潮位 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper10 to 2>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper10 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
傍晚的海雾从防波堤外贴水漫进来，港口横链外有一条没挂船头灯的运煤驳船正顺着暗流往礁石边偏。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>提着夜航灯走到栈桥中段，说驳船吃水太深转弯慢，得有人在桥头遮光打三短一长的引航灯语，或爬上高桩挂起防撞红灯。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper11>>运煤驳船已经循着灯号稳稳滑进二号内泊位。<<else>>雾里的铁链声越来越近。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回栈桥日务 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[接过灯打信号 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper11 to 1>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper11 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬上木桩挂防撞灯 (0:09)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 9>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper11 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper11 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
天亮前一场急雨让船屋斜顶的椽缝漏了水，水滴正落在舱床枕边的一只搪瓷盆里。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>等雨停后搬出木梯、沥青油毡与压边石板，说海边的屋顶不能光靠钉子，钉眼会被盐雾锈穿，得铺双层油毡再用重石压住迎风边。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper12>>船屋顶的漏缝已经严严实实封住，舱里重新干爽下来。<<else>>他扶稳木梯看你先递料还是上顶。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回栈桥日务 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[扶稳木梯递料 (0:08)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper12 to 1>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper12 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬上屋顶铺平油毡 (0:09)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 9>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper12 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper12 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
早潮退到底时，标示航道礁脊的绿漆浮标搁浅在泥滩上，锚链被昨夜侧浪扯松了半截。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>换上高筒涉水靴，扛起铁锤与钢钎，说必须在涨潮前把浮标推回深水槽，再把锚桩往岩缝里重砸三寸。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper13>>绿浮标已经重新稳稳浮在航道拐角，锚链绷得笔直。<<else>>滩涂淤泥没过脚踝，两人合力才推得动。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回夜潮港务 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[涉泥滩推浮标 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper13 to 1>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper13 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[挥起铁锤砸实锚桩 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper13 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper13 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
天黑透以后，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把滚烫的海藻姜茶灌进旧锡壶，用厚帆布裹了两层，又搭上一件干爽的粗呢外套。栈桥尽头守灯的老船工昨夜在寒风里咳了一宿，玻璃灯罩上也凝了一层混着煤灰的白盐。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper14>>老船工披着干外套喝完热姜茶，栈桥尽头的风灯也擦得透亮。<<else>>海风在木桩间呼啸，老人的岗亭亮着豆大的黄光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回夜潮港务 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[递姜茶陪守夜 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper14 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper14 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[替老人擦净旧灯罩 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper14 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 230 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper14 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Date 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
平潮将至，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>往柳条筐里码好新灯芯、菜油罐与折得方正的信号旗。他看了一眼黄铜水尺，说外礁那座无人值守的红漆灯船该上去检修一回了，趁平潮风稳划小艇过去正好靠舷。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远航专页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[应下乘艇出港 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先问清外礁平潮窗 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 5>><<if !$daily.mpLock_MPNPCVesperDate5_3>><<set $daily.mpLock_MPNPCVesperDate5_3 to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Date 5 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
小艇贴上外礁灯船左舷时，海面平得像一块压过的青铁。甲板红漆被海盐蚀出斑驳白痕，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>试了试左舷软梯的承重：桅顶灯室要换灯芯添菜油，底舱锚链要查验磨损，小艇缆绳也得有人在舷边看着防浪。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回内港 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Date 5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬桅进室换芯 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Date 5 After]]>><<pass 15>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper5 to "lamp">><</link>><br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[下底舱查铁锚链 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Date 5 After]]>><<pass 15>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper5 to "chain">><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[守在左舷看护艇缆 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Date 5 After]]>><<pass 15>><<tiredness 1>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper5 to "boat">><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Date 5 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateVesper5Done>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper5Done to 1>>
<<set _ok to (($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 240 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8)>>
平潮一过，外礁灯船随着暗流极慢地转过船头，水下锚链发出沉稳的轻响。<<if _ok>>桅顶新换的灯芯亮起一团澄澈的暖光，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>站在甲板边替你拢紧被海风吹散的衣领，说往后夜航回港看到这盏灯就会想起今晚。<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -4>><<else>>回程时海雾骤起，涌浪拍湿了船尾，好在他掌稳舵柄把小艇平安带回了栈桥。<<stress 2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远航专页 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[迎着灯色回栈桥 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Date 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
鱼市后头的旧船坞趁春潮最低时拖上了一条待拆的老木船。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>站在石砌斜坡顶往下看，说那是他早年当水手时跑过的第一条船，船尾还钉着一块刻有船名的旧铜牌，他想赶在铜铁归炉前把那块名牌取回来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远航专页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[随他走下船坞 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先问清铜名牌来历 (0:05)|MP NPC Vesper Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 5>><<if !$daily.mpLock_MPNPCVesperDate6_3>><<set $daily.mpLock_MPNPCVesperDate6_3 to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Date 6 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
老船架在三道墩木上，宽肩拆船匠握着磨亮的铁撬棍，说船尾铜牌按斤两早算进了废铜账，不白送人。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>看了看船台：可以好好跟拆船匠谈价折换，可以趁拆解前钻进底舱自己起钉，也可以干脆帮着落几根沉船骨抵账。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回上页 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Date 6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[同拆船匠谈价 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Date 6 After]]>><<pass 15>><<tiredness 1>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper6 to "talk">><</link>><br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[趁拆前钻舱起钉 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Date 6 After]]>><<pass 15>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper6 to "hull">><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[搭手抬船骨抵铜牌 (0:15)|MP NPC Vesper Date 6 After]]>><<pass 15>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper6 to "labor">><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Date 6 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateVesper6Done>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateVesper6Done to 1>>
<<set _ok to (($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8)>>
船坞里的木屑越积越厚，拆船大锯重新拉响。<<if _ok>>那块带着海盐绿锈的旧铜牌终于完好地起到了手里，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>用拇指摩挲过上面凹陷的字母，回船屋后将它钉在了水尺正上方。<<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -4>><<else>>铜钉锈死在橡木船尾里，撬下时折了一角，他还是小心地用帆布包好带回了船屋。<<stress 2>><</if>>
栈桥下的暗流轻轻拍打着木桩，风灯在潮湿的舱板上映出一圈暖黄。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远航专页 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[带旧铜牌回栈桥 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Festival Prep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _year to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
海雾节前第七夜，浓雾从外海压上三号栈桥。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把防风灯一字排在舱板上，先读过水尺才开口：「灯油、船帆、进港货单，三样备齐，返航夜才敢点引路灯。」<<if (_npc.festivalPromise or 0) is (Time.date.year or 0)>>去年缺的那一夜，他仍把最亮的一盏灯留在老位置。<</if>><<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 35>>他把主航灯交给你掌管。<<else>>他让你挑一样先备妥。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[去备节前物料 (0:10)|MP NPC Vesper Festival]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.festivalPrepYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>><<stress -2>><</link>>
:: MP NPC Vesper Festival [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
海雾节当天，潮水在午后转平，外海灯船挂出三短一长的回港灯语。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把栈桥引航灯逐盏点亮，说今夜远航船要从浓雾里归港，守栈桥等船、随快艇出雾接人、或是留在码头分发入库货物，三条路都算交货。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回专页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[守在栈桥等船 (0:16)|MP NPC Vesper Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.festivalRoute to "pier">><</link>><br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[随快艇出雾接人 (0:18)|MP NPC Vesper Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.festivalRoute to "boat">><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[留在码头分卸货箱 (0:12)|MP NPC Vesper Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 12>><<tiredness 3>><<set _npc.festivalRoute to "dock">><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Festival Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _year to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
<<set _route to (_npc.festivalRoute or "pier")>>
<<set _ax to (_npc.axis or 0)>>
<<set _stat to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($willpower or 0), (_ax * 4)) + ((_npc.festivalPrepYear or 0) is _year ? 40 : 0)>>
<<set _res to (_stat gte 220 ? "success" : _stat gte 140 ? "partial" : "fail")>>
<<set _first to ((_npc.festivalYear or 0) isnot _year)>>
浓雾里的引航灯一盏盏排开，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>按你选定的路把船摆正。<<if _res is "success">>破晓前归港船稳稳靠上三号栈桥，货未过水、人也齐整，他把舱单推到你面前让你落下记号。<<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _ax + 6)>><<set _npc.manifests to (_npc.manifests or 0) + 1>><<stress -4>><</if>><<elseif _res is "partial">>船平安靠岸，只是外层两只货箱受了潮，他挑出湿箱重记数目，说下趟潮水再补回来。<<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _ax + 2)>><<stress -1>><</if>><<else>>暗流顶着浓雾绕了半宿，船头空着回来，这一夜没有一文钱进账，契约刻度也往下掉了两格。<<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.max(0, _ax - 2)>><<mpalert 3>><<stress 3>><</if>><</if>><<set _npc.festivalYear to _year>><<set _npc.festivalResult to _res>>
栈桥下的暗流轻轻拍打着木桩，风灯在潮湿的舱板上映出一圈暖黄。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远航页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _res is "fail">><<mpboaticon>><<link [[查看今年错过灯语 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Festival Missed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[收灯回船屋 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Festival After]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[陪他清点归航灯 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Festival After]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Festival After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _res to (_npc.festivalResult or "partial")>>
海雾节过后的栈桥重归平静，雾灯一盏盏擦净收进木箱。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>在三号栈桥的灯钩下站了片刻，温了一壶海藻茶推给你。<<if _res is "success">>他翻开压在船钟底下的新舱单，说今年这一夜交得干净，往后夜航主舵随时有你半个位置。<<elseif _res is "partial">>他把受潮的木箱拆开晾在栈桥背风处，说明年提前看准东南风向就能避开侧浪。<<else>>他默默盘好湿缆绳，说海上的账向来有来有往，等下一次大潮再把空舱补满。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远航专页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[陪他盘好湿缆绳 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Festival Missed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _year to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
海雾节返航那夜，栈桥的灯没能排成一路。次日清早海雾未散，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>在三号栈桥尽头独自守了一整宿，风灯烧到只剩一豆残火。他把空灯钩一个个取下收进木箱，没问你缘由，只说雾里的船等不到岸灯就会往深水退，明年节前七天栈桥还留着你的灯位。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回远航专页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[应下明年来掌灯 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<set _npc.festivalPromise to (_year + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 10 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper10 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper10 or 0)>>
潮水退到石阶第三级，风灯把船屋门框照出一圈暖黄。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把烧红的铁签从炭盆里夹出来，杉木板上升起一缕细烟。<<if _act is 1>>他握着你的手腕往下压，<<if _ok>>最后一格平流线烫得笔直匀净，他嗯了一声，把潮痕板挂回门框正中。<<else>>焦痕歪进旧刻里，他接过铁签替你补了两道，才勉强压平。<</if>><<else>>你把黄铜水尺抵在木板边上，<<if _ok>>报出的潮位与他日志上记的分毫不差，他提笔在旁边添了你的名字。<<else>>读数差了半寸，他移开水尺自己重算，没作声，只把热茶往你手边推。<</if>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyVesper10>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper10 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 11 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper11 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper11 or 0)>>
雾从防波堤外贴着水面漫进来，铁链在暗处叮当作响。运煤驳船的黑影贴着雾缓缓偏过来，船工朝栈桥挥了挥手。<<if _act is 1>>你举灯的手一直没歇，<<if _ok>>三短一长的灯语一次没乱，驳船顺着光稳稳滑进内泊位，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把灯罩擦净递还给你。<<else>>灯语打到一半被浪打偏，驳船在白影里转了半圈，好在最后自己摸回了航道。<</if>><<else>>你抱着防撞红灯爬上高桩，<<if _ok>>红灯在桩顶亮起，驳船贴着灯影擦过去，连船舷都没蹭到，他在桥头抬了抬下巴。<<else>>风把灯绳吹得缠在桩上，红灯只亮了半边，驳船擦过时刮掉一层新漆。<</if>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyVesper11>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper11 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 12 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper12 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper12 or 0)>>
雨停后船屋的椽缝还在滴水，搪瓷盆里一下一下地响。木梯架在湿墙上，沥青油毡的焦味混着海盐，压边石板码在梯脚。<<if _act is 1>>你守在梯下把油毡一张张递上去，<<if _ok>><<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>在上头压好最后一块石板，漏雨的缝被封住，舱里重新干爽下来。<<else>>一阵侧风掀起油毡一角，他只好拆了重铺，多耗了小半个时辰。<</if>><<else>>你踩着湿滑的梯级上到檐口，<<if _ok>>双层油毡铺得平平整整，迎风边压满重石，他站在檐下仰头看了很久才点头。<<else>>脚下一滑，油毡皱成一团，他赶紧扶住梯子，两人对着那道褶子苦笑。<</if>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyVesper12>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper12 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 13 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper13 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper13 or 0)>>
早潮退到底，滩涂上的淤泥泛着冷光，绿漆浮标的铁链半埋在泥里。<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把钢钎往岩缝里一插，潮声在远处闷闷地滚。<<if _act is 1>>两个人抵着浮标一寸寸往前挪，<<if _ok>>浮标终于回到航道拐角，锚链绷得笔直，绿漆在晨光里亮得扎眼。<<else>>淤泥比想得深，浮标推到半途又滑回去，他摆摆手说明早再来。<</if>><<else>>你抡起铁锤朝锚桩砸下去，<<if _ok>>锚桩咬进岩缝三寸，锤声闷实，他蹲下摸了摸桩头，说这下夜船能安心了。<<else>>第三锤砸偏在石棱上，木柄震得虎口发麻，桩子只进去了浅浅一截。<</if>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyVesper13>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper13 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Daily 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActVesper14 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkVesper14 or 0)>>
天黑透以后海风更硬，栈桥尽头的岗亭只亮着豆大的黄光。锡壶里的姜茶还烫手，粗呢外套裹得严实，脚下的木桩结了一层薄盐。<<if _act is 1>>你把姜茶倒进老人的搪瓷缸，<<if _ok>>老船工捧着缸子一口口喝完，咳嗽渐渐平了，<<if _npc.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>在旁边把灯芯挑亮一格。<<else>>茶倒得太急洒了半缸，老人还是笑着道谢，他重新替你续满。<</if>><<else>>你摘下灯罩一点点擦，<<if _ok>>煤灰和盐渍擦净后，灯光清澈地铺开，岗亭外的石阶都被照亮了。<<else>>灯罩上的盐壳太厚，你用力过猛擦出一道划痕，他接过去用软布慢慢补救。<</if>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyVesper14>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyVesper14 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
